thorough check versus jumping right in. I guess it really depends on the context and what the script is supposed to do. Let me decide soon!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’ll run the kidney pipeline on the CT image you attached and then summarize the key outputs in a clean, patient-facing way.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_057c1d92677879510169ba8f2e4eb48191895a54deef93ed12\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_CG2qNiGcKGl5gbjXzII0Tt6S|fc_057c1d92677879510169ba8f2e5f1881918216d9479fa80848","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/scripts/pipeline_execution_tool.py --telegram-user-id 495506013 /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_2---9c686727-585f-401a-89ed-eee7b27318a9.jpg","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":180},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/scripts/pipeline_execution_tool.py --telegram-user-id 495506013 /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_2---9c686727-585f-401a-89ed-eee7b27318a9.jpg\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent\",\"yieldMs\":1000,\"timeout\":180}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2471,"output":159,"cacheRead":9984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12614,"cost":{"input":0.006177500000000001,"output":0.002385,"cacheRead":0.002496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0110585}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773834024224}}
